0.6 w 54.00 747.00 m 558.00 747.00 l S
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (Firsthand Failure Modes, Traps & Economics Checks) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 693.77 Tm (The most expensive failure is opening a channel too early or bolting it on too late. Luasai [9ijiF4Aas8o @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 678.55 Tm (00:03:22] watches ISVs hire direct reps first and land about six months behind. They then retrofit a channel) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 663.32 Tm (and end up having to double pay the channel and the reps. Of the 10 to 20 ISVs they cite, very few get the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 648.10 Tm (mix right. Willingness to Pay [_pp2kmBgn7s @ 00:01:17] reports more channels failing than succeeding) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 632.87 Tm (across 30-plus client projects and often ends up killing the channel outright. The same speaker warns) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 617.65 Tm ([_pp2kmBgn7s @ 00:47:03] that a partner is never going to be better at selling your product than you are, so) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 602.42 Tm (direct sales get fixed first. Viktor from Sales [6Z4v3jibmMw @ 00:01:40] adds the founder trap. Teams turn) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 587.20 Tm (to partners only when they hit a growth ceiling, then discover several problems at once. Partners take longer) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 571.97 Tm (to nurture than direct deals, they expect leads from the vendor too, and they often sign up for the logo and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 556.75 Tm (then never sell, or undercut on price. Luasai names the mindset error underneath all of it. Founders expect) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 541.52 Tm (partners to be grateful, but partners are often bigger businesses, and recruiting one is like hiring a rep on) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 526.30 Tm (commission only.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 511.07 Tm (Partner sprawl and deal-size misfit kill programs that look healthy on paper. Luasai [9ijiF4Aas8o @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 495.85 Tm (00:25:51] warns against recruiting 200 partners with 195 sitting idle, and against importing Palo Alto) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 480.62 Tm (playbooks into a Series A company. Viktor from Sales [6Z4v3jibmMw @ 00:36:27] recounts the big-logo) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 465.40 Tm (version at Accenture, where roughly 100 users out of 200,000 people in India alone was not enough. Small) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 450.17 Tm (agencies of 10 to 100 people moved faster. Willingness to Pay [_pp2kmBgn7s @ 00:21:01] puts a number) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 434.95 Tm (on the misfit: about three of four partner agreements fail on ACV. A $200k product inside a $500k) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 419.72 Tm (system-integrator project is too big at 40% of the deal. A $5k product adds only about 0.2% and is too small.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 404.50 Tm (The sweet spot is 5 to 15% of the partner's deal, roughly $25k to $75k. The same speaker tracks a partner) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 389.27 Tm (funnel where 100 surveyed partners yield 2 closed, then watches for silent-partnership churn after signing.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 374.05 Tm (Recruiting itself grinds. chanimalvideos [hdz5UsJS-qY @ 00:44:53] reports a record of seven calls just to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 358.82 Tm (reach one channel manager, and finds that 60 to 70% of vendor sites miss sign-up basics.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 343.60 Tm (Funding traps sit inside MDF and co-op mechanics. Marketing Business Network [gPoVTzxEwPw @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 328.37 Tm (00:01:41] lays out the chain: proposal, approval, activity, claim with evidence, then payment. The speaker) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 313.15 Tm (stresses that an approved budget is not automatically a payment. With a 50% match capped at $1,000, a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 297.92 Tm ($1,600 event returns $800. A missed deadline or unapproved spend can leave the partner paying the whole) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 282.70 Tm (bill. Pete Matheson [lcMWkAWGxSU @ 00:01:43] warns that some vendors demand proof of ROI, leads,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 267.47 Tm (conversion rates and sales. Mostly bigger MSPs claim the funds, while smaller ones don't know about them,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 252.25 Tm (don't understand them, or don't use them. ZINFI Technologies [lET3Wc2a74o @ 00:00:59] explains why as) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 237.02 Tm (much as 60% of MDF goes unused each quarter. The vendor is an add-on, partners under $5 to 10M plan) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 221.80 Tm (quarterly, and they lack dedicated marketers. Corruption sometimes reaches into channel management) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 206.57 Tm (itself. The Crancer Group [dM62o5Vq5U4 @ 00:06:19] shows the Microsoft version of the leak. A $0) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 191.35 Tm (balance means no designation, or not yet past the $10K threshold. Checking every location, plus hosting) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 176.12 Tm (co-op and Surface rebates, surfaced an extra $5 to 7K, and in other cases $20 to 50K.) Tj ET
