BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 621.77 Tm (The biggest firsthand trap in consumption reselling is fraud liability. Drew Simones, TD SYNNEX's CISO,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 606.55 Tm (lays it out: under the reseller agreement, consumption billed to the customer is the reseller's responsibility,) Tj ET
