BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 576.10 Tm (hyperscaler is neither inclined nor required to waive costs from fraud or misuse of a customer's account or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 560.87 Tm (credentials, and Simones warns that many resellers lack the balance sheet to absorb three, four or five) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 545.65 Tm (million dollars in fraudulent charges, losses Simones calls material and even existential [8xAn9TMt7Ew @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 530.42 Tm (00:04:17]. Speed is the killer: attackers can run up millions in days or sometimes hours, well before most) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 515.20 Tm (organizations notice, and every hyperscaler is exposed to this kind of fraud, which makes it lucrative and) Tj ET
