BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 484.75 Tm (maps: 96% of the industry is partner-assisted whether sold direct, through a marketplace or indirect,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 469.52 Tm (because that is how money flows in a subscription, consumption and now micro-consumption model) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 454.30 Tm ([SwebwmaZR2I @ 00:02:24]. Simones' bottom line is blunt: you cannot count on the hyperscaler absorbing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 439.07 Tm (those losses on your behalf, so awareness, early detection and prevention are the partner's job.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 423.85 Tm (Simones breaks the attack down by vector and warns that criminals are financially motivated to keep) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 408.62 Tm (inventing new ones. Most common is a compromised credential, almost always on an account with no MFA) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 393.40 Tm (enabled and often lost to phishing, which the attacker then uses to spin up compute or extend the) Tj ET
