BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 362.95 Tm (reseller's doorstep is impersonation: AI makes it easy to forge synthetic or stolen IDs and research a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 347.72 Tm (company convincingly enough to pass onboarding, and when the company does not exist there is nobody to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 332.50 Tm (go after except the reseller [8xAn9TMt7Ew @ 00:08:28]. The controls Simones teaches are concrete: MFA) Tj ET
