BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (lapses, followed by a $75,000 cumulative catch-up [WeV8GbQwaPE @ 00:05:30]. Accounting: Concierge) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (CPA reduces step one to the same blunt test: is this a real enforceable arrangement and do we actually) Tj ET
